  "ingredients": [
    "2 (8 ounce) packages cream cheese, softened",
    "0.75 cup white sugar",
    "2 eggs",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "1 graham cracker crust, unbaked",
    "1.25 cups mango nectar",
    "0.33333334326744 cup white sugar",
    "2 tablespoons cornstarch",
    "2 cups ripe mangoes, peeled, pitted, and diced"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zaY-IoyNCBPXCyBQVbgw5e9OA08=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139953-trini-mango-cheesecake-VAT-001-step-01-b90c496dcf244901861ab00b6cf6b66e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/139953/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix 3/4 cup of sugar and cream cheese in a medium bowl. Mix in eggs one at a time, then stir in vanilla.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/v2iFLo5rQMvCnenHFTEJp81ozqI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139953-trini-mango-cheesecake-VAT-002-step-02-73a94757595849938a9650a70592fcaa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/139953/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour mixture into graham cracker crust, and smooth over the top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BH8Z5c-4mY_ktQHpDCAjFK_x16M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139953-trini-mango-cheesecake-VAT-003-step-03-d20b54689ace42fc8bff8c0bfe4f536e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/139953/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in preheated oven until the edges have puffed up but the middle still jiggles, about 30 minutes. Allow to cool for 30 minutes, then refrigerate cheesecake until cold, about 3 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QKwFbhKEnF9f8aPjTMpkYDj4ktM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139953-trini-mango-cheesecake-VAT-004-step-04-e7499f441bf2495b920dd8b142396930.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/139953/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While cheesecake is baking, make the mango topping: Pour 1 cup of mango nectar and 1/3 cup of sugar into a saucepan; bring to a boil over medium-high heat to dissolve the sugar. Dissolve cornstarch in the remaining 1/4 cup of mango nectar; stir into the boiling saucepan until thickened and clear, about 30 seconds.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Cgy7QxNRMyZdVNtxFr9oz9-umIM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139953-trini-mango-cheesecake-VAT-005-step-05-9aa8b04695d14a9ba653ede26f17ac20.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/139953/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place diced mango into a heatproof bowl, and toss with the thickened sauce.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/c8sgtnZBLeMctPq61gvyfkwZh54=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139953-trini-mango-cheesecake-VAT-006-step-06-92056c232efd470a8d77901470b9fc44.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/139953/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Allow to cool to room temperature, then pour over the cheesecake. Serve cold.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8PIrERUMqPkp5pPSL0kSKmWOMy0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139953-trini-mango-cheesecake-VAT-007-step-07-2417fcb9cd7e4ca1afaf60528a10d92c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/139953/step_07.webp"
    }
